# Nothing at the repo root should be an image or a binary. A mistyped build
# output (dist\paneboard-new.exe losing its separator) lands here as a 68 MB file
# that "git add -A" would otherwise commit.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.gif
/*.webp
/*.exe

# AI assistant instructions. These carry local deployment details (the port
# 5001 instance, control-token paths, the swap-in-place flow) that only apply
# to one machine. Contributor-facing conventions live in CONTRIBUTING.md.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
# Same reason: local Claude Code and Codex settings and skills describe the port
# 5000/5001 split, the worktree layout, and the control-token shutdown path.
.claude/
